# Cloudflare's published IPv4 + IPv6 ranges, the ONE list Caddy uses for:
#   - `trusted_proxies` (Caddyfile): whose CF-Connecting-IP is believed;
#   - the remote_ip gate on the staging vhosts (conf.d/staging.caddy):
#     who may connect at all.
# Loaded into the caddy container by docker-compose.yml (env_file), and read
# by the Caddyfiles as {$CLOUDFLARE_IPS} (one space-separated line).
#
# Source: https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v4 and https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v6
# Fetched: 2026-10-28
# Refresh: ./caddy/refresh-cloudflare-ips.sh, then README §5.3 "Refreshing the ranges".
# Never hand-edit the line below.
CLOUDFLARE_IPS=173.245.48.0/20 103.21.244.0/22 103.22.200.0/22 103.31.4.0/22 141.101.64.0/18 108.162.192.0/18 190.93.240.0/20 188.114.96.0/20 197.234.240.0/22 198.41.128.0/17 162.158.0.0/15 104.16.0.0/13 104.24.0.0/14 172.64.0.0/13 131.0.72.0/22 2400:cb00::/32 2606:4700::/32 2803:f800::/32 2405:b500::/32 2405:8100::/32 2a06:98c0::/29 2c0f:f248::/32
